From: Tolga <tolga_kaan_eskin@proton.me>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 11:22:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(Core/Battlegrounds): handle empty random map candidates

Return the existing no-battleground sentinel when no configured map survives template and level checks, before weighted selection dereferences the empty container.
---
 src/server/game/Battlegrounds/BattlegroundMgr.cpp | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/server/game/Battlegrounds/BattlegroundMgr.cpp b/src/server/game/Battlegrounds/BattlegroundMgr.cpp
index 00c31f5..a023950 100644
--- a/src/server/game/Battlegrounds/BattlegroundMgr.cpp
+++ b/src/server/game/Battlegrounds/BattlegroundMgr.cpp
@@ -935,6 +935,9 @@ BattlegroundTypeId BattlegroundMgr::GetRandomBG(BattlegroundTypeId bgTypeId, uin
             }
         }
 
+        if (ids.empty())
+            return BATTLEGROUND_TYPE_NONE;
+
         return *Acore::Containers::SelectRandomWeightedContainerElement(ids, weights);
     }
 

